  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Staff (professional and technical) component costs reported by Alleweldt et al. (2021) for whole-genome sequencing (WGS) and conventional methods, for eight laboratory settings covering avian influenza, influenza A+B and food-borne pathogens (2021 USD).",
